# Anti-Patterns Quick Reference

| Don't | Do |
|-------|-----|
| Claim "done" without runtime verification | Run code, check terminal for errors, verify output |
| Create V2/Refactored/New alongside original | Refactor in place; delete old code |
| Keep parallel code paths after refactor | Single code path; delete old; see delete-deprecated.mdc |
| TODO in code | GitHub issue |
| File >900 lines | Split by SRP |
| Hardcode config values | Centralize in config files |
| Duplicate components for different roles | One component, data-driven scoping |
| Create `*_SUMMARY.md` / `*_STATUS.md` files | Report results as text in chat |
| `git push main` directly | Use repo's merge/PR workflow |
| Imports inside functions | Imports at top of file |
